-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Linux installer (Installers/Linux)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This installer redistributes nothing. It installs your distribution's own
packages through apt: nginx, PHP, MariaDB, transmission-daemon, optionally
FFmpeg, and Node.js (from the distribution or NodeSource). Those packages come
under their own licences, which the distribution supplies.
Each package's licence is in /usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright. Setup copies
LICENSE and NOTICE into the application directory. The relay's npm packages,
installed by `npm ci`, keep their own licence files in netplay/node_modules.

